WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:00.467
[birds chirping]

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:13.847
[indistinct television]

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:16.916
- UM, HI.
ARE YOU EARL PEELE?

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:19.853
- WHO THE HELL WANT TO KNOW?

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.688
- [exhales sharply]

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:23.723
I THINK I'M YOUR SON,
JORDAN PEELE.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:27.660
- OH, OKAY, I SEE.

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.596
COME ON IN HERE FOR A MINUTE.

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:32.832
CLOSE THE DOOR ON THE WAY IN.
- ALL RIGHT.

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:37.904
- ALL RIGHT, MAN, GO AHEAD
AND HAVE A SEAT THERE.

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:38.872
I'M GONNA EXPLAIN SOMETHING
TO YOU.

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:40.273
- OKAY.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:45.678
[both sigh,, sniff, grunt]

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:48.248
- I AIN'T YOUR DAD.

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.016
ALL RIGHT,
I'M SORRY TO DISAPPOINT YOU,

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:52.819
BUT THAT'S
THE SITUATION, BROTHER.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.488
- ARE YOU--
YOU SEE WHAT'S HAPPENING?

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:58.158
- HUH?
- WE'RE DOING THE SAME THING.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.160
I-I ALWAYS DO THIS.
I ALWAYS SCRATCH

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.128
THE BACK OF MY NECK
LIKE THIS

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:04.597
WHENEVER I'M IN
AN UNCOMFORTABLE SITUATION.

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:07.934
- SCRATCH MY NECK, MAN.
EVERYBODY SCRATCH THEIR NECK.

00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:11.504
I BREATHE IN AND OUT TOO, MAN.
NOW EVERYBODY MY KID?

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:13.440
- OKAY, LOOK AT THIS.

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.108
THAT'S A PICTURE OF ME WHEN
I WAS A BABY.

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:18.211
THAT'S MY FATHER.

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:20.246
- THAT AIN'T ME.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.215
MAN, LOOK, LOOK, MAN,
LOOK AT THAT DUDE'S AFRO.

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:24.317
LOOK, I GOT THIS
GOING ON, MAN.

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:27.320
MY HAIR IS GRAY,
HE GOT BLACK HAIR.

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:30.590
I MEAN, HE HANDSOME AS HELL,
BUT I AIN'T NOBODY'S DADDY.

00:01:36.095 --> 00:01:39.232
- I'M SORRY.

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.000
I'VE JUST BEEN LOOKING
FOR HIM EVERYWHERE.

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:42.869
- YEAH, YEAH.
I'M SURE YOU HAVE.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:46.539
- IT'S JUST,
I GOT MY OWN TV SHOW NOW.

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:50.543
[sighs]

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:52.579
I DON'T KNOW,
I JUST--

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:56.349
I KNOW THAT WHEREVER HE IS,
HE--HE WOULD BE PROUD.

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:57.884
- Y-YOU GOT YOUR OWN TV SHOW,
HUH?

00:01:57.951 --> 00:01:59.652
- YEAH.
- YEAH.

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:01.688
- YEAH,
I'M PRODUCING AND ACTING.

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:04.424
- MM, OH, YOU, OH,
YOU PRODUCING AND ACTING!

00:02:04.491 --> 00:02:06.993
RIGHT, OKAY, YEAH, THAT--
OH, THAT--THAT'S MY BOY.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.062
[laughs]
- [laughs]

00:02:09.128 --> 00:02:10.763
- YEAH, LOOK AT THAT, MAN,
WE DOING THE SAME THING.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.032
WHAT IS THAT?
HOLY [bleep].

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:15.635
THAT'S GENES RIGHT THERE, MAN.
'CAUSE YOU CAN'T DO THAT

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:17.537
UNLESS YOU SHARING MAD GENES
WITH SOMEBODY.

00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:19.205
IT'S GOT TO BE IN YOUR DNAs.
- NO.

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:21.808
- [gasps] OH!
- ALL RIGHT.

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:23.810
- YOU MY SON.
- NO.

00:02:23.877 --> 00:02:25.211
- MY BABY BOY!
- THANKS FOR YOUR TIME.

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:27.013
- YOU COME BACK HOME, MAN.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.982
I MISSED YOU SO MUCH,
LITTLE MAN!

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.950
- OKAY, HEY, STOP IT.
STOP--GET OFF, GET OFF!

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:32.852
JUST GET OFF--GET OFF!
- GET OFF, WHA--OH, HEY.

00:02:32.919 --> 00:02:38.124
OH.
- [sighs]

00:02:38.191 --> 00:02:42.428
WHEN I FIRST CAME TO YOUR DOOR,
YOU WOULDN'T EVEN ACKNOW--

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:06.553
OKAY.
- OKAY.

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:08.388
- YOU KNOW WHAT?
WHEN I FIRST CAME IN HERE--

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:10.590
- I FIRST CAME IN HERE--
- STOP THAT!

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:13.226
- WHEN I FIRST CAME IN HERE,
YOU WOULDN'T EVEN ACKNOWLEDGE

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:15.161
THAT I COULD POSSIBLY
BE YOUR SON.

00:03:15.228 --> 00:03:17.363
BUT NOW,
ONLY AFTER I TELL YOU

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.699
THAT I HAVE MY OWN SHOW
ON COMEDY CENTRAL--

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:23.803
- WHOA, WHOA, WHOA, WHOA, WHOA.
COMEDY CENTRAL?

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.538
GET THE [bleep]
OUT OF MY HOUSE!

